rs in Japan.\n", "short_description": "The Australian Open VR app is your ticket to the best immersive and interactive experience from the Rod Laver Arena. Content available only for users in Japan.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "748208292787655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568674_748208299454321_9199275796024111845_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yCe_ffQxBBsQ7kNvwEWVQkZ&_nc_oc=AdrlCgFTrzK1uLEDUqVI5F-9Mn1-UwgxRpBCGl_RE8Ku_vjYs03xywQOM89QH0Alxbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3dNyPXUndH1w3lJsHTVcjnpLwJeAaw-KSGVhh4RG4pXQ&oe=69D79839"}, {"file_name": "Hero Cover.png", "id": "704643830420157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230051_704643833753490_981048534016631306_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dXcnrt17gP8Q7kNvwGzP_0C&_nc_oc=AdpBkExTR_XMlJ5-cTFs9RyI5s7-u2PCxv4khuR_uWNWEMnPgsgjSBJsFuVHws9KSgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Igl6Nnn0SciXuNTLaZaImf6_mU6D7MgN2E3c37O7Q9g&oe=69D78AC9"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "483520132656129", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75666286_483520139322795_3526818540801169626_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iLfiZCQz_bUQ7kNvwEd171v&_nc_oc=AdpR3Z_kT83GNC91leVwm6Q63xUSF1blTHRXu4E0g6mo7SSYWEtfreeS4h20yR5LuFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1R9YelzwmVqIhwIqku9_o66OfOP1rHxR47kFdIFmTgPg&oe=69D78EAE"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "426648561976328", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_426648565309661_6996016450691187172_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wIPqq7dmQyMQ7kNvwEF9yoZ&_nc_oc=AdoouWn0CkFyqw9J7KdDqWIU8jDavWSi3bKOQFHYTZ9Gv_GUEpt2iDqD_561Qfn_zzQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-f